        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Dear Patron,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I wanted to extend my sincere thanks for taking the time to meet us today. We greatly value your patronage and appreciate the relationship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rest assured, we will work upon the insights you have shared, we are fully committed to supporting your needs and ensuring that our collaboration continues to be mutually beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have any further questions or require additional information, please reach out to me.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you once again, and we look forward to your continued patronage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!$Record.Owner:User.FirstName}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!$Record.Owner:User.MobilePhone}&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
